<title>UK: Energy Group poised for U.S. acquisition-paper.</title>
<headline>Energy Group poised for U.S. acquisition-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Energy Group Plc, the electricity and coal supplier demerged from Hanson last month, is set to make its first significant investment, paying up to $100 million for a U.S. power marketing company, The Independent newspaper said on Friday.</p>
<p>The paper said the deal will be unveiled next week and is one of several acquisitions being examined by the group.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
